arter of blowouts.","I'm not worried about Tampa Bay The Big Guava Pirates quitting. I'm worried about us getting complacent.","Confidence comes from preparation, not scoreboards. We prepared well.","Fun is winning in January. This was just work.","Letdown? Teams with our ambition don't have letdowns."],"mid":["We executed the game plan well across all three phases.","Credit to the coaches, they put us in good positions.","My 7/9, 188 yds, 5 TD, 0 INT is a result of the guys up front doing their job.","It's a good win, but it's one of seventeen. On to next week.","We stayed focused for four quarters, that's what I'm proud of.","No, we weren't trying to run it up, just executing our offense.","It's always good to get a win, especially at home.","We'll watch the tape, correct mistakes, and move forward.","Team win. Everybody contributed.","We'll enjoy it tonight, back to work tomorrow."],"low":["Man, we were just out there having fun. Felt good.","I don't know, everything was clicking. Felt easy.","7/9, 188 yds, 5 TD, 0 INT? Cool, I'll take it. Hope my fantasy owners are happy.","Statement game? Nah, just another Sunday.","We kept the foot on the gas 'cause, why not? It's fun scoring.","Confidence is cool and all, but I'm just trying to enjoy the ride.","Did they quit? Maybe. Not really my problem.","Letdown next week? We'll see. I'm gonna enjoy this tonight.","Coach left us in, I guess he wanted us to get our numbers.","I'm just happy we won and nobody got hurt."]}}],"audioCueQueue":[],"pendingHalftimeDecision":null},"breakingNewsQueue":[],"ownerPersonalityInbox":[],"commissionerDisciplineLog":[],"earnedDoctrines":[],"seasonNearMissReceipts":[],"apologyTourThreads":[],"lastPortableExportYear":null,"ceremonies":[],"dynastyTimeline":[{"id":"named-game-2026-1-2fa0puhva","year":2026,"week":1,"type":"named_game","headline":"The Coin Flip: Theme Park Capital Rollercoasters vs BBQ Fountains","importance":"major","playerIds":[],"teamIds":["2fa0puhva","wm5qz8j1h"],"namedGame"